            "description_html": "<b>RK International CF-904, 3 Inch Petal Cabinet Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nTruly beautiful, RK International's Petal Cup Pull's design has movement that elevates it above its competitors. It has a 3 inch center to center and is available in 6 finishes. This cabinet cup pull is easy to install as it comes with the installation screws. Made out of solid brass, the petal cabinet cup pull will add a fancy touch to any small drawer in your home.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the RK International CF-904 Petal Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Length c.c. (center to center): 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Length Overall: 4-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Width: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Packaged with all necessary installation hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/MUL-T-LOCK-TSR25_size.gif?v=1704354575\" width=\"600\" height=\"133\" border=\"0\" alt=\"RKI Finishes Diagram\">\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
